{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1492848-nameless-order-question","id":1492848,"title":"Nameless Order Question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-09-11T19:21:08-07:00","id":1492848,"title":"Nameless Order Question","content":"Hi, somewhat new to Mage the Awakening. If a Mage is in a Nameless Order do they get the free dot of Order Status + High Speech and Occult dot (as they technically are in an Order), but not the Rote Skills. Or do they have to be in one of the primary orders to obtain such benefits? Finally, can the Mage in question purchase Order Status in their given Nameless Order, or is it entirely replaced by Mystery Cult Initiation, and if so does that initiation then act as Order Status for the requisitioning of items?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26413-thatonekiasyd","name":"ThatOneKiasyd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26413_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-11T20:23:01-07:00","id":1492854,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ThatOneKiasyd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1492848-nameless-order-question#post1492848\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi, somewhat new to Mage the Awakening. If a Mage is in a Nameless Order do they get the free dot of Order Status + High Speech and Occult dot (as they technically are in an Order), but not the Rote Skills. Or do they have to be in one of the primary orders to obtain such benefits? Finally, can the Mage in question purchase Order Status in their given Nameless Order, or is it entirely replaced by Mystery Cult Initiation, and if so does that initiation then act as Order Status for the requisitioning of items?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nameless Orders are modeled with the Mystery Cult Initiation Merit, which can provide them with Rote Skills as its third dot's benefit per the &quot;Nameless&quot; sidebar on page 80. Order Status is for non-Nameless Orders; per the sidebar, if you're not part of the Diamond, the Seers, or the Free Council, you don't get the free dot of Order Status, free dot of Occult, and free training in High Speech. This is a technicality that specifically does not exist.<br /> <br /> Being that it isn't Order Status on account of specifically not being an organization with the global heft of one of the Sects, Status in a Nameless Order cannot be used to requisition things from the Caucuses and Convocation it doesn't have. If you're a member of a Consilium you can requisition things through the usual channels there, but otherwise belonging to a Nameless Order only affords you the same &quot;access to group facilities, resources, and funding&quot; you'd get from Mystery Cult Initiation dots doubling as Status dots in the group.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-12T02:33:29-07:00","id":1492873,"title":"","content":"Just the reminder if necessary that mages innately understand the High Speech, the training is to be able to use it as a Yantra.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}